.PP
.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SH "Autoprefixer [![Cult Of Martians][cult-img]][cult]"
.PP

.PP
\fRPostCSS\fP plugin to parse CSS and add vendor prefixes to CSS rules using values from \fRCan I Use\fP\&. It is recommended by Google and used in Twitter and Alibaba\&.

.PP
Write your CSS rules without vendor prefixes (in fact, forget about them entirely):

.PP
.PP
.nf
::placeholder {
  color: gray;
}

\&.image {
  background\-image: url(image@1x\&.png);
}
@media (min\-resolution: 2dppx) {
  \&.image {
    background\-image: url(image@2x\&.png);
  }
}
.fi
.PP

.PP
Autoprefixer will use the data based on current browser popularity and property support to apply prefixes for you\&. You can try the \fRinteractive demo\fP of Autoprefixer\&.

.PP
.PP
.nf
::\-moz\-placeholder {
  color: gray;
}
::placeholder {
  color: gray;
}

\&.image {
  background\-image: url(image@1x\&.png);
}
@media (\-webkit\-min\-device\-pixel\-ratio: 2),
       (min\-resolution: 2dppx) {
  \&.image {
    background\-image: url(image@2x\&.png);
  }
}
.fi
.PP

.PP
Twitter account for news and releases: \fR@autoprefixer\fP\&.

